  "details": "A lot of us never set a radius on dynamic bones, because we weren't using colliders for the sake of performance. But now, there's thousands of avatars that could have grabbable and poseable hair, but because they don't have any radius, that can't be done.\nI understand that this would break the \"accuracy\" of the conversion, which is why it should be an option/toggle, it would reload the avatar and set a small radius on all components.",
